---

<BaseLayout
  title={`${productName} | 果汁茶饮灌装线`}
  description="6000BPH 果汁灌装机适用于PET瓶果汁、茶饮、风味饮料和功能饮料生产，包含设备参数、生产线模块和完整方案说明。"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />

  <article class="product-detail-page product-detail-page--rich product-detail-page--square-hero product-detail-page--compact-title product-detail-page--juice">
    <section class="product-hero product-hero--rich">
      <div class="container product-rich-hero-inner">
        <div class="product-hero-breadcrumb-bar">
          <nav class="product-breadcrumb" aria-label="面包屑导航">
            <a href="/">首页</a>
            <span>/</span>
            <a href="/products/">产品中心</a>
            <span>/</span>
            <a href="/products/filling-machine/juice-tea-filling-machine/">果汁茶饮灌装机</a>
          </nav>
        </div>

        <div class="product-hero-heading">
          <p class="product-kicker">不含气饮料灌装线</p>
          <h1>{productName}</h1>
        </div>

        <dl class="product-rich-stats" aria-label="产品关键参数">
          {heroStats.map(([label, value]) => (
            <div>
              <dt>{label}</dt>
              <dd>{value}</dd>
            </div>
          ))}
        </dl>

        <div class="product-hero-content">
          <div class="product-hero-showcase">
            <div class="product-hero-gallery" data-product-gallery>
              <div class="product-hero-thumbs" role="tablist" aria-label="6000BPH 果汁灌装机图片">
                {heroGallery.map((image, index) => (
                  <button
                    class:list={['product-hero-thumb', index === 0 && 'is-active']}
                    type="button"
                    role="tab"
                    aria-selected={index === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
                    aria-label={`显示 ${image.label}`}
                    data-gallery-thumb
                    data-gallery-src={image.src}
                    data-gallery-alt={image.alt}
                  >
                    <img src={image.src} alt={`${image.alt} 缩略图`} width="120" height="120" loading={index < 4 ? 'eager' : 'lazy'} decoding="async" />
                  </button>
                ))}
              </div>
              <div class="product-hero-frame">
                <button class="product-hero-gallery-btn product-hero-gallery-btn--prev" type="button" aria-label="上一张产品图片" data-gallery-prev>
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M15 18 9 12l6-6"></path>
                  </svg>
                </button>
                <div class="product-hero-media">
                  <img src={heroGallery[0].src} alt={heroGallery[0].alt} width="960" height="960" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-gallery-main />
                  <div class="product-hero-cert-badges" aria-label="认证标识">
                    <span>CE</span>
                    <span>ISO</span>
                    <span>SGS</span>
                    <span>CNAS</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <button class="product-hero-gallery-btn product-hero-gallery-btn--next" type="button" aria-label="下一张产品图片" data-gallery-next>
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path>
                  </svg>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="product-hero-form-card" id="quote">
            <div class="product-hero-intro-card">
              <p class="product-hero-intro-eyebrow">产品简介</p>
              <h2>6000BPH 果汁灌装机</h2>
              <p>
                这款非碳酸饮料灌装机适用于果汁、茶饮、风味饮料等非气泡饮品的灌装。它集冲洗、灌装和封盖于一体，结构紧凑，有助于提高效率并保持生产的稳定性。我们的机器设计注重卫生灌装、运行可靠以及灵活的瓶子兼容性。它可以与混合、杀菌、贴标和包装设备连接，形成完整的饮料生产线。广泛应用于具有不同生产需求的非碳酸饮料工厂。
              </p>
              <a class="product-hero-phone-button" href="tel:18962223666" aria-label="拨打电话 18962223666">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.3 19.3 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .4 1.9.7 2.8a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8.1 9.9a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.2a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.5c.9.3 1.8.6 2.8.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2Z"></path>
                </svg>
                电话咨询：18962223666
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-section product-summary-strip">
      <div class="container product-summary-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="product-kicker">企业实力</p>
          <h2 class="section-title--secondary">20余年行业经验，提供可靠的整线解决方案</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="product-summary-cards">
          <div><strong>20+</strong><span>年行业经验<small>丰富的设备制造与项目实施经验</small></span></div>
          <div><strong>整线</strong><span>交钥匙方案<small>从方案设计到安装调试一站式服务</small></span></div>
          <div><strong>CE / ISO</strong><span>国际认证<small>严格质量管理，符合国际标准</small></span></div>
          <div><strong>50+</strong><span>国家和地区<small>设备远销全球，提供完善售后支持</small></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-section product-overview product-section--white" id="overview">
      <div class="container product-overview-layout">
        <div class="product-overview-head">
          <div>
            <p class="product-kicker">产品中心 产品概述</p>
            <h2 class="section-title--primary">紧凑型果汁茶饮瓶装线</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="product-overview-copy">
            <p>本项目6000BPH 果汁灌装机适用于PET瓶果汁、茶饮和风味饮料生产。可按单台灌装机报价，也可配置饮料调配、灌装、贴标和包装等完整生产线模块。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-line-flow-group">
          <figure class="product-layout-figure">
            <img src={`${assetBase}/6000bph-juice-filling-machine-complete-line-layout.webp`} alt="6000BPH 果汁灌装机完整生产线布局" width="1600" height="456" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </figure>
          <div class="product-process-caption-strip" aria-label="果汁灌装线流程">
            {processSteps.map(([title, text], index) => (
              <div class="product-process-item">
                <span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
                <h3>{title}</h3>
                <p>{text}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-section product-spec-section" id="specifications">
      <div class="container">
        <details class="product-spec-disclosure" open>
          <summary>
            <span class="product-spec-summary-copy">
              <span class="product-kicker">技术规格</span>
              <span class="section-title--primary">6000BPH 果汁灌装机 参数</span>
            </span>
            <span class="product-spec-summary-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="product-spec-disclosure-body">
            <div class="juice-tech-table-wrap">
              <table class="juice-tech-table" aria-label="技术参数: 果汁热灌装线">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>型号</th>
                    {juiceTechColumns.map((column) => <th>{column}</th>)}
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  {juiceTechRows.map((row) => (
                    <tr>
                      <th scope="row">{row[0]}</th>
                      {row.length === 2 ? (
                        <td colspan={juiceTechColumns.length}>{row[1]}</td>
                      ) : (
                        row.slice(1).map((value) => <td>{value}</td>)
                      )}
                    </tr>
                  ))}
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-section product-feature-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="product-section-head">
          <p class="product-kicker">设备细节</p>
